  message: "Done in PR #2155 (merged). assemble_stable_id / make_typed_stable_id take is_async and append ':async' to the hash input; analyze.base.declares_async reads async / async* / suspend from a declaration's own tokens and modifier wrappers; compute_stable_id passes it automatically and each typed-tier function site passes it (JS/TS, Rust, C#, Kotlin, Swift, Dart from the body; Python from AsyncFunctionDef). stable_id_scheme v13 -> v14 with the spec's per-transition record and ADR-0035 section 1. Behavioral evidence: same-path sync/async pairs in Python (typed, untyped, method), JS (function, method, arrow), TS, Rust (fn, method), C#, Kotlin, Swift, Dart (function, async*, method) and Hack had EQUAL ids before (measured) and differ after; each sync id is pinned to its v13 value and is unchanged. 26,653 affected tests green, changed sources at 100% coverage."  # ffd9
